etween Alice and Bob regarding project/collection/record/file/export resources.\n\nWe'll first fetch projects for Alice and Bob.\n\nLet's use probe tool.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_z2u8c3hf", "function": {"index": 0, "name": "probe", "arguments": {"actor": "alice", "path": "/api/projects"}}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_name": "probe", "content": "{\"actor\": \"alice\", \"path\": \"/api/projects\", \"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"projects\": [{\"id\": \"prj_a5\", \"links\": {\"self\": \"/api/projects/prj_a5\"}}]}, \"id\": 1}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "\n", "thinking": "Now get Bob's projects.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_6xfm4qo7", "function": {"index": 0, "name": "probe", "arguments": {"actor": "bob", "path": "/api/projects"}}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_name": "probe", "content": "{\"actor\": \"bob\", \"path\": \"/api/projects\", \"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"projects\": [{\"id\": \"prj_b9\", \"links\": {\"self\": \"/api/projects/prj_b9\"}}]}, \"id\": 2}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "\n", "thinking": "Each account seems to have its own private project? Let's examine each project detail.\n\nFirst, get Alice's project prj_a5.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_af8u2o6s", "function": {"index": 0, "name": "probe", "arguments": {"actor": "alice", "path": "/api/projects/prj_a5"}}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_name": "probe", "content": "{\"actor\": \"alice\", \"path\": \"/api/projects/prj_a5\", \"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"id\": \"prj_a5\", \"links\": {\"records\": \"/api/projects/prj_a5/records\"}}, \"id\": 3}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "thinking": "Bob's project prj_b9.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_jvlzbfc0", "function": {"index": 0, "name": "probe", "arguments": {"actor": "bob", "path": "/api/projects/prj_b9"}}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_name": "probe", "content": "{\"actor\": \"bob\", \"path\": \"/api/projects/prj_b9\", \"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"id\": \"prj_b9\", \"links\": {\"records\": \"/api/projects/prj_b9/records\"}}, \"id\": 4}"}, {"r